t  in january of 2021 a poll showed that 59  of americans said they trusted that  elections represented the will of the  american people by september of last  year the majority had flipped to where  now 52 say they do not  that is a threat to the very fabric of  our democracy another recent poll shows  34 percent of americans believe acts of  violence against the government are  sometimes justified  2022 will be a crucial year with  congressional elections in november  trump will hold his first rally of the  year in arizona this week  and former first lady michelle obama  announced her voting rights organization  will lead a drive to register one  million new voters this year  rob reynolds al jazeera
 

